Z||000001||AL||06-10-2000||08:27 PM||||HEY IRON doesn't your car have the hose diagram on your deck lid? and as far as the trany put in 3 quarts to start and then start the car up and measure the fluid with the car on,  and you keep adding until it's almost full,in between the add and full line, if you don' have a diagram on your deck lid, tell me i'll send you a pic.||||reg||1
